  "question": {
    "text": "<strong>Paragraph:</strong>\nTwo plane harmonic sound waves are expressed by the equations.\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& y_1(x, t)=A \\cos (0.5 \\pi x-100 \\pi t) \\\\\n& y_2(x, t)=A \\cos (0.46 \\pi x-92 \\pi t)\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n(All parameters are in MKS)<strong>Question:</strong>\nHow many times does an observer hear maximum intensity in one second?",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "os1MP",
      "text": "\n4\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
