      "text": "\n8",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "In one second number of maximas is called the beat frequency. Hence,\n$$\nf_b=f_1-f_2=\\frac{100 \\pi}{2 \\pi}-\\frac{92 \\pi}{2 \\pi}=4 \\mathrm{~Hz}\n$$",
    "image": null
  },
